<p>Dear API User,</p>

<p>As part of our <b>API Security Enhancement Program</b>, your API keys will be rotated in <b>72 hours</b>. This is a mandatory security measure following the October 2026 security incident.</p>

<h3 style="color:#F0B90B;border-bottom:2px solid #F0B90B;padding-bottom:4px">Affected API Keys</h3>
